ly for  paid leave to self-quarantine the  company also provided this photo  showing plastic barriers between workers  but  another photo provided by an employee a  day later  appears to show the same barriers rolled  up and there's still people getting sick  we had a person test positive the other  day  [Music]  what do we do fighting back  might soon become more difficult if  there's  any red line it's on litigation senate  republicans have a new bill that would  shield companies from  some coronavirus lawsuits workers have  already filed suits against  walmart amazon mcdonald's and tyson  foods  what do you say to workers who worry  that your liability protections  basically give their employers license  to avoid taking the kinds of precautions  that would keep them  safe this is mainly to protect them  because the employers would only  be liable if they were grossly negligent  a month before his death  mike jackson and his co-workers  protested the lack of safety equipment  at the plant  federal safety regulators are now  investigating the worker's complaints  they should take responsibility if they  were to protect  their workers i think my son probably  still had been here  for cbs this morning saturday i'm nancy  cordes on capitol hill
 

